  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that RNA-only multiprofile models with scvi_n200 encoder (config_005, 0.65 accuracy) outperform singleprofile and pca_n2000. This experiment tests whether combining RNA (scvi_n200) with image data (resnet50) in a multimodal setup improves performance. It isolates the effect of multimodal fusion while using the best-performing RNA encoder and image encoder, addressing the key uncertainty about whether multimodal approaches can surpass RNA-only models."
